'''Mods''' are community-authored plugins that extend or modify ''Human Host''. All mods for the game currently ship as BepInEx plugins (BepInEx is pre-installed with the game).

For instructions on installing mods and writing your own, see '''[[Modding]]'''.

== Featured mod suites ==

=== [[HHMods|The HHMods Suite]] ===

A 22-mod suite spanning five categories, developed against the game's public managers. Each mod ships as an independent plugin that can be added or removed without breaking the others.

{| class="wikitable"
! Plugin !! Category !! Highlights
|-
| '''[[HHMods Minimap]]''' || HUD || Toggleable minimap using the game's built-in [[CompassPro]]. Public layer API.
|-
| '''[[HHMods Perks]]''' || Perks || Five new perks: [[Alchemist]], [[Metallurgist]], [[Geologist]], [[Panning Out]], [[Pitcher]].
|-
| '''[[HHMods Recipes]]''' || Crafting || Water, Gunpowder, Steel Chest recipes.
|-
| '''[[HHMods QoL]]''' || Quality of life || Color-coded hunger / thirst, empty-container tooltip, filtered / linked containers.
|-
| '''[[HHMods Vehicles]]''' || Vehicles || Gyroscope, Headlights, Tow bar, Collector, Impact Shielding.
|-
| '''[[HHMods Weapons]]''' || Weapons || Proximity Mine, Impact Grenade, Throwing Axe, Nailgun.
|}

See [[HHMods]] for the full suite overview and architecture.

